_To face page 4._] [_Lovibond, Colour Theories._
]

CHAPTER II.Evolution of the Method.

(Suspense) Ridgway comes forward pleadingly;
Alice hesitates and starts at what her father is saying; at length
nods yes....

A Situation always germinates further life-action;
death terminates a line of action and eliminates forever an active
participant.
